This schema allows for efficient management of hotel rooms and their availability. It includes necessary fields such as hotel name, address, and contact details, as well as room attributes like number, type, capacity, amenities, price, and availability. The schema also establishes a relationship between the Hotel and Room documents using a foreign key reference (hotelId). This design ensures optimal performance and ease of use with MongoDB's document-oriented storage model.

